1
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,440
Mayor Zeng's orders have come down.

2
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,280
This is the official letter.

3
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,040
From now on,

4
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:03,960
the investigation into the Jingxiang Society case

5
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,400
must be stopped immediately.

6
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,920
They were right.

7
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,520
Where is Zhou Wei?

8
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,920
This case is related to the concession and the church.

9
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,080
Why can't we investigate it?

10
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:14,160
Precisely because it's related to the church and the concession,

11
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,520
we can't investigate it.

12
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,360
I must investigate it.

13
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,720
Have you lost your mind?

14
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,400
Believe it or not, I'll fire you.

15
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,920
The truth is right in front of us.

16
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,880
As long as we sort out

17
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:22,960
the relationship between the cases,

18
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,200
we can give an answer to the pile of bones in the suburbs,

19
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,200
the bodies in the church,

20
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,800
and those missing children.

21
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,240
I just don't understand.

22
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,840
Why can't we investigate?

23
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,600
Those are all cases of the Fenghuang Police Station.

24
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,720
What does it have to do with us?

25
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,960
Our duty

26
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,520
is to protect the rights and maintain the security

27
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:37,360
of foreigners in the concession.

28
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,160
Foreigners?

29
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,039
Chief Inspector Zhu.

30
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:44,840
Don't forget,

31
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:47,039
our concession is also in this city,

32
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,320
on Chinese land,

33
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,360
and Chinese compatriots live here too.

34
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,160
They are living in misery now.

35
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,720
You say you are responsible for foreigners,

36
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:56,720
but aren't you responsible for Chinese compatriots?

37
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:05,920
Hello, boss.

38
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,520
This kid Zhou Wei might ruin things.

39
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,410
Why are you here?

40
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,480
I heard everything.

41
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,520
I...

42
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,360
I'm going all out.

43
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,880
Can I

44
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:30,120
treat you to some steamed buns?

45
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:40,760
Special Commissioner Huang has already

46
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,600
reported to the General Police Station.

47
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,120
Public opinion on the case is overwhelming now.

48
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,320
It won't be suppressed.

49
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:47,320
That depends on the police station.

50
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,650
Inspector Zhou,

51
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,960
how is your investigation going?

52
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,280
The police station forbade investigating this case.

53
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,140
Senior Sister.

54
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,560
This kid has some guts.

55
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,200
To investigate the case,

56
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,600
he fell out with his boss.

57
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,040
We can't wait any longer.

58
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,560
The sooner we find clues, the better.

59
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,220
Shi'an,

60
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,280
come with me to investigate the church.

61
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,960
Ningning,

62
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,960
take Inspector Zhou to investigate the believers.

63
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,800
Yes.

64
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,560
Officer Jiang,

65
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,560
we meet again.

66
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,920
George Badinger,

67
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,200
we suspect you are involved in

68
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,240
the crime of trafficking women and children.

69
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,600
Please cooperate with the investigation.

70
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,460
Officer Jiang,

71
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:39,120
I am very worried about your future.

72
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,640
If this time

73
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,760
you don't find the result you want,

74
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,760
do you know what you will face?

75
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,090
You will be charged with abuse of power

76
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,520
by the concession.

77
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,800
Then the Chinese police

78
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,360
won't be able to save you.

79
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,200
I know.

80
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,079
But the result I want,

81
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,560
I will definitely get it.

82
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,160
Now please take off your clothes.

83
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,480
I will know at a glance.

84
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,280
You...

85
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:11,800
Miss.

86
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,700
Are there any religious believers around here?

87
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:18,180
I'm talking to you. Why are you...

88
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,760
Come take a look.

89
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:24,800
Boss.

90
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,880
Have you seen someone this... Go, go, go.

91
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:27,880
Go, go, go.

92
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:28,960
You...

93
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:33,880
You guys.

94
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,320
Where are you going dressed like that?

95
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,800
Have you seen a man this tall?

96
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,840
No, no.

97
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,440
Hey.

98
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,360
Hey.

99
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,840
Ignoring us again.

100
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,640
We didn't find anything.

101
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:48,480
Many believers are not cooperating with the investigation.

102
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,080
Even if a few cooperate,

103
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:53,159
they don't know about Wei Xiaodong's situation back then.

104
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,000
If George doesn't have

105
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,880
the colorful krait tattoo on him,

106
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,159
does this case have nothing to do

107
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,200
with the church?

108
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,360
Impossible.

109
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,240
Now that

110
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,220
things have gotten so out of hand,

111
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:05,010
if we still can't find anything this time,

112
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,080
we'll look like fools.

113
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,720
There must be some clues

114
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,920
we haven't found yet.

115
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,840
Think about it again.

116
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,770
I think we can keep investigating.

117
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:19,120
The situation is quite clear now.

118
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:22,360
Someone wants us to keep investigating.

119
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,880
Whether it's a man or a ghost,

120
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:26,140
it's time to drag them out into the light.

121
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,560
Siyao.

122
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:41,010
You seem to be under a lot of stress lately.

123
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,040
How about

124
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,040
I go to your place and make you a bowl of soothing soup?

125
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,040
What do you think?

126
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,120
No need.

127
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:47,090
I won't drink it.

128
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,920
Don't be like that.

129
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,680
Let me tell you,

130
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,640
I make a really good soothing soup.

131
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:53,440
I sincerely suggest you try it.

132
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,850
Someone is here.

133
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,320
I know.

134
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,040
I still feel like someone

135
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,560
is watching us in the dark.

136
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,360
Are you scared?

137
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,320
I'm a cop. What should I be afraid of?

138
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,040
Let's go.

139
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,600
I'll go back with you.

140
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,520
Someone's there.

141
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,840
We finally caught him.

142
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,600
Lin Jinwen.

143
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,580
I know it's you.

144
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,440
Come out!

145
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,640
There must be

146
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:56,040
Wei Xiaodong's preaching records in here.

147
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,960
Every time we encounter difficulties in our investigation,

148
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:00,320
this mysterious person provides clues.

149
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,480
Is Lin Jinwen really not dead?

150
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,960
It is now certain

151
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:13,480
that the one who abducted Wei Xiaodong from Li Youcai

152
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,960
and recruited him into the cult

153
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,600
is a monk named Zhao Bin.

154
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,240
Just a few months before Wei Xiaodong's accident,

155
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,440
he also disappeared.

156
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,600
This preaching record,

157
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,520
I haven't even seen it at the police station.

158
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,880
What's the background of this mysterious person?

159
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:25,810
He's so capable.

160
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,000
Our top priority right now

161
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,280
is to find this man named Zhao Bin.

162
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,480
Why are we back at Hengtong Warehouse?

163
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,540
Haven't we checked it several times?

164
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,080
Since you're still alive,

165
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,760
why won't you come see me?

166
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:37,780
He must be here.

167
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:38,960
Not here.

168
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:39,880
Let's go.

169
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,280
He's right here. Let's go.

170
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,120
Not here.

171
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,240
Ye Shian, surrender.

172
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,080
Jiang Siyao.

173
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,770
What are you doing here?

174
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,000
Commissioner Huang.

175
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
I'm sorry.

176
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,920
Did you just see a...

177
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,380
Did the masked man come in?

178
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,760
The masked man?

179
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,640
Commissioner Huang.

180
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:01,400
Sorry.

181
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,300
We came to the wrong place.

182
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,920
We'll visit another day.

183
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,840
Young man.

184
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,640
What is your name?

185
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,090
Ye Shian.

186
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,640
I'm sorry, Commissioner Huang.

187
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,200
Go.

188
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,760
Get out.

189
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,520
Ye Shian.

190
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,960
Do you think the person who keeps sending clues

191
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,620
could be Special Envoy Huang?

192
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,140
I don't think it's him.

193
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,440
Superintendent Jiang,

194
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,640
who do you think it is?

195
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,440
All right.

196
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,050
Let's drop this for now.

197
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,080
Our focus now is

198
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:41,060
to figure out how to find Zhao Bin.

199
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,080
Check

200
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:44,040
the household registration records from that year.

201
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:44,880
Screen

202
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,160
anyone under fifteen.

203
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,840
But many people don't have household registration.

204
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,480
And with the famine a few years ago,

205
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,160
many fled to other places.

206
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,580
Who would be foolish enough to stay here?

207
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,540
The world is in such chaos.

208
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,000
How far could a fifteen-year-old child

209
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,800
possibly run?

210
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,880
Then where do you think he would go?

211
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,920
He's most afraid of being found by the church.

212
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:06,320
Where would the church people

213
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,580
be least willing to go?

214
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,200
Other religious places.

215
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:11,720
Exactly.

216
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,400
It's highly likely

217
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,640
that he ran to some temple

218
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,800
and became a monk.

219
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:19,000
The only temple that still takes in and relieves the poor

220
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,730
and receives many worshippers

221
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,360
is Dabei Temple.

222
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,200
You're also suspecting Jiang Siyao,

223
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,860
aren't you?

224
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,120
I'm warning you.

225
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,440
Don't test my limits.

226
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,080
You won't get what you want.
